00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:34.700
Privacy means what happens to the personal stuff you type, and over-reliance means leaning

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:37.520
on the tool so hard you stop practicing your own thinking.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:42.880
Even helpful AI needs guardrails, like the bumper lanes at a bowling alley, when people

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:44.600
are still figuring out their own judgment.

